From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Martin=20Pu=C5=A1k=C3=A1=C4=8D?= <martin@icebear.sk>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:02:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t7001: Add UART3
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Describe UART3, the Bluetooth UART, disabled until a board enables it,
with its TX/RX and RTS/CTS pins. It reaches 3 Mbit/s with the T8010
oversampling of the apple,t7000-uart compatible.

[Orchard: from mattonik/ipad-nixos b94d42f kernel/patches/0001-t7001-add-uart3-node.patch and 0002-t7001-air2-enable-uart3.patch, handed to Orchard by micro23 (ipadair2-omarchy 7ea2b2b); the pins are TX/RX 14, 15 and RTS/CTS 32, 33 in function 1, from the ADT uart3 function-tx and function-rts, whose flags UART5's working function 1 calibrates, instead of function 2 on 14 and 32 only; the 3 Mbit/s baud factor (0092, 0093) comes from the apple,t7000-uart compatible.]
Signed-off-by: Martin Puškáč <martin@icebear.sk>
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi
index 92b08b0..1a666e7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi
@@ -154,6 +154,18 @@
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
+		serial3: serial@20a0cc000 {
+			compatible = "apple,t7000-uart", "apple,t8010-uart", "apple,s5l-uart";
+			reg = <0x2 0x0a0cc000 0x0 0x4000>;
+			reg-io-width = <4>;
+			interrupt-parent = <&aic>;
+			interrupts = <AIC_IRQ 161 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			clocks = <&clkref>, <&clkref>;
+			clock-names = "uart", "clk_uart_baud0";
+			power-domains = <&ps_uart3>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 		serial5: serial@20a0d4000 {
 			compatible = "apple,t7000-uart", "apple,t8010-uart", "apple,s5l-uart";
 			reg = <0x2 0x0a0d4000 0x0 0x4000>;
@@ -362,6 +374,13 @@
 					 <APPLE_PINMUX(134, 1)>;
 			};
 
+			uart3_pins: uart3-pins {
+				pinmux = <APPLE_PINMUX(14, 1)>,
+					 <APPLE_PINMUX(15, 1)>,
+					 <APPLE_PINMUX(32, 1)>,
+					 <APPLE_PINMUX(33, 1)>;
+			};
+
 			uart5_pins: uart5-pins {
 				pinmux = <APPLE_PINMUX(34, 1)>;
 			};
